       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 2400 mg per dose four times daily comes to 9,600 mg/day. That's three times the maximum daily ibuprofen dose of 3,200 mg/day for adults. A dose like that risks GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nYou may have meant 2400 mg total per day. That would be 600 mg four times daily. Typical options for an adult are:\n- **Mild to moderate pain:** 400 mg every 4\u20136 hours as needed, or 600 mg every 6 hours.\n- **Inflammatory conditions such as arthritis:** 400\u2013800 mg three or four times daily, up to 3,200 mg/day.\n\nPlease confirm the dose you want, for example 600 mg PO four times daily, and I'll enter it right away. It's also worth checking the order with your resident or supervising physician."
